      "displayName": "Doron Shalvi",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3Ae5e5c5e0-6548-43bb-82e6-e50570cc5e41",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "It may be useful to have these as separate options; an option to NOT migrate inactive, and a separate option to NOT migrate deleted.  This would seem to give the most flexibility.  I suppose it would be possible to have a whitelist approach of migrate \"active only\" (similar to head-only), but two separate NOT options seems more flexible.  Thanks!",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
